--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
parse error
--
N5008 [dcl.ref]/1: references cannot be cv-qualified, but GCC/Clang accept a
`__restrict`-qualified reference (`T & __restrict`) as an extension.  Regression
test for the parse error that blocked any translation unit including <typeinfo>
(libstdc++ <cxxabi.h> declares __class_type_info::__do_upcast with a
`__upcast_result& __restrict` parameter).  const/volatile on a reference remain
ill-formed and are still rejected.
